        "q": "What is the difference between torch.exp() and torch.exp_(), or between torch.relu() and torch.relu_()?",
        "a": "torch.exp() returns a copy of the input tensor while torch.exp_() modifies it in place. Similarly, torch.relu() returns a copy while torch.relu_() modifies in place."
